        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Psa 63:1-11 . The historical occasion referred to by the title was probably during Absalom's rebellion (compare 2Sa 15:23 , 28 ; 16:2 ). David expresses an earnest desire for God's favor, and a confident expectation of realizing it in his deliverance and the ruin of his enemies."
